# Keep a published stylesheet pin aligned with its documented recipe

## Root cause

The site documents the `.scroll` recipe from carve-css 0.1.8, but the manifest accepts 0.1.7 and the lockfile installs that older release. A clean install can serve the recipe without its CSS.

## Change

Set the manifest's carve-css floor to the release that supplies the documented recipe and regenerate the lockfile. Verify the installed package version and build the docs with that dependency.

## Scope

The manifest and lockfile together define the site's installed dependency. Keeping both at a release that implements the documented behavior addresses any page using the recipe, rather than one example page.
